{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/630627-deva-corporation-s-name","id":630627,"title":"Deva Corporation's name","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-17T21:22:51-07:00","id":630627,"title":"Deva Corporation's name","content":"Does anyone else have the problem of these interesting antagonists (and potential HtV protagonists) straining cradulity because of their name? I mean, isn't that the equivalent of a company in the West naming itself something like &quot;Jesus Incorporated&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T21:50:40-07:00","id":630682,"title":"","content":"It's also used as a surname, both historically and contemporarily; see also the Spanish given name Jesus. There have been corporations named Angel Incorporated, too.<br /> <br /> And hey, if a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deva_%28music_director%29\" target=\"_blank\">film soundtrack composer</a> can get away with calling himself Deva, a conglomerate parent company would probably have a pretty easy time of it, especially considering most people are going to be discussing its subsidiary companies by name, not the parent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T21:54:18-07:00","id":630685,"title":"","content":"No especially. Plenty of corporations cite religious principles in how they conduct their operations (let's not get started on how sincere they are, I'm not pulling the pin on that grenade) and many more take their names from religion or myth: Nike, Venus, Pandora, Amazon etc.<br /> <br /> I'm sure the company gets odd looks in New Dehli, but the corporation was founded by the family of someone calling himself the &quot;Pain Prophet.&quot; Deva Corporation is downright tame in a way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 08-18-2015, 10:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T22:08:54-07:00","id":630694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agentwestmer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/630627-deva-corporation-s-name?p=630685#post630685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No especially. Plenty of corporations cite religious principles in how they conduct their operations (let's not get started on how sincere they are, I'm pulling the pin on that grenade)</div> </div> </div> </div>It's the religious people I imagined might have a problem with it, not that the company would be seen as too religious.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> and many more take their names from religion or myth: Nike, Venus, Pandora, Amazon etc. </div> </div> </div>Hinduism is a major world religion, that's kind of a different situation that names borrowed from ancient stories that the only believers in are reconstructed-religions.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm sure the company gets odd looks in New Dehli, but the corporation was founded by the family of someone calling himself the &quot;Pain Prophet.&quot; Deva Corporation is downright tame in a way. </div> </div> </div>That isn't public knowledge is it?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T22:24:28-07:00","id":630707,"title":"","content":"Given that a quick google revels that a number of Indian companies use the name Deva, including a major satellite communications firm, and that their are dozens of companies owing the same on the global scale, I see no reason to give Deva Corp another name. <br /> <br /> Also of note: <a href=\"http://thinkprogress.org/justice/2013/02/26/1634371/jesus-trademark/\" target=\"_blank\">http://thinkprogress.org/justice/201...sus-trademark/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-18T04:16:14-07:00","id":630996,"title":"","content":"The analogy would only fit if it was Krishna instead of Deva, but even then, I don't think it would be worthy of being considered more than an oddity. There would be an issue of creating confusion over associating the corporation with a religion. In this case, Deva is used as the word rather than an identifier for deities. I have no idea how it plays out in India and Nepal, but the rest of the world considers &quot;deva&quot; to be Hindu deities as a second definition. The first would be &quot;divine.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-18T04:30:28-07:00","id":631013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/630627-deva-corporation-s-name?p=630707#post630707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given that a quick google revels that a number of Indian companies use the name Deva, including a major satellite communications firm, and that their are dozens of companies owing the same on the global scale, I see no reason to give Deva Corp another name. ...</div> </div> </div> </div>Am I the only one horrified by the implications here?!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-18T08:07:38-07:00","id":631188,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DesolateDolly</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/630627-deva-corporation-s-name?p=631013#post631013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Am I the only one horrified by the implications here?!</div> </div> </div> </div>Institutions of global scale and influence being named after a word that refers to a class of gods in one of the world's oldest and largest religion, the same word also being the etymological root of 'divine'. And at least one of those institutions govern a form of technology that manipulate one of the most fundamental aspects of human society, from an extraterrestrial position. <br /> <br /> Yup, sounds like the God-Machine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5789-acanthus","name":"acanthus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T19:52:41-07:00","id":632973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>acanthus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/630627-deva-corporation-s-name?p=631188#post631188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Institutions of global scale and influence being named after a word that refers to a class of gods in one of the world's oldest and largest religion, the same word also being the etymological root of 'divine'. And at least one of those institutions govern a form of technology that manipulate one of the most fundamental aspects of human society, from an extraterrestrial position.<br /> <br /> Yup, sounds like the God-Machine.</div> </div> </div> </div>It sounds <b>exactly</b> like the God-Machine! <i>The truth is out there.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}